ver/merge_persons","description":"合并两个人物\n\n参数:\n- person_a_id: 必填，保留的人物ID\n- person_b_id: 必填，要合并到A的人物ID\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- merged_into: 合并到的人物ID\n- name: 保留的名称\n- photo_count: 合并后的照片数量\n- deleted_person_id: 被删除的人物ID\n\n说明:\n- 保留 person_a 的名称\n- 合并所有人脸向量，重新计算中心\n- 更新所有照片关联\n- 学习机制：如果相似度低于阈值，自动调整阈值","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"person_a_id":{"type":"string","description":"保留的人物ID"},"person_b_id":{"type":"string","description":"要合并的人物ID"}},"required":["person_a_id","person_b_id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/ingest_photos","description":"智能照片入库（自动判断单张/多张/目录）\n\n参数:\n- source_path: 必填，文件路径或目录路径\n- category: 分类（生活/工作/旅行/证件/其他）\n\n两种模式:\n1. 目录路径 → 批量模式：保持原目录结构，整体搬迁\n2. 文件路径 → 单张模式：按模板重命名、人脸识别、分类存储\n\n批量模式返回:\n- total: 照片总数\n- success: 成功数\n- target_path: 目标目录\n\n单张模式返回:\n- photo_id: 照片ID\n- detected_persons: 检测到的人物\n- file_path: 存储路径","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"source_path":{"type":"string","description":"文件路径或目录路径"},"category":{"type":"string","description":"分类（生活/工作/旅行/证件/其他）"}},"required":["source_path"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/search_persons","description":"搜索人物（按名字语义相似度）\n\n参数:\n- query: 搜索词（人名）\n- limit: 返回数量（默认10）\n\n返回:\n- 匹配的人物列表，按相似度排序","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","description":"搜索词（人名）"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"返回数量","default":10}},"required":["query"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/get_unnamed_persons","description":"获取所有未命名人物\n\n返回:\n- 未命名人物列表，按出现次数排序\n- 包含：id, auto_label, photo_count, photos","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/delete_person","description":"删除人物及其所有关联数据\n\n警告：这会删除人物图谱中的节点，请谨慎使用。\n只有在用户明确要求删除时才调用。\n\n参数:\n- person_id: 要删除的人物ID\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- message: 结果说明","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"person_id":{"type":"string","description":"人物ID"}},"required":["person_id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/cleanup_deleted_photos","description":"清理已删除照片的数据库记录\n\n在删除照片文件/目录后调用，清理数据库中的孤儿记录。\n扫描 photos 表，删除文件不存在的记录及其关联的 faces 记录。\n\n返回:\n- deleted_photos: 删除的照片记录数\n- deleted_faces: 删除的人脸记录数\n\n使用场景：\n- 用户删除了照片目录后\n- 清理数据库中的残留记录","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/get_person_photos","description":"获取某人物的多张照片（用于\"换一张\"场景）\n\n当用户说\"看不清\"、\"换一张\"时调用此工具。\n\n参数:\n- person_id: 人物ID\n- limit: 最多返回几张照片（默认5）\n\n返回:\n- person_id, person_name\n- photos: [{file_path, bbox, taken_at}, ...]","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"person_id":{"type":"string","description":"人物ID"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"最多返回几张（默认5）"}},"required":["person_id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/store_document_l1","description":"存储单个文档的 L1 摘要到向量库\n\n当 ingest_document 返回 status=\"need_l1\" 时，调用此工具存储生成的摘要。\n\n参数:\n- file_path: 必填，文档存储路径（从 ingest_document 返回值获取）\n- l1: 必填，极简格式摘要：标题|关键词|摘要|实体|类型|指针\n- l2: 可选，完整内容（如果不提供则只存储 L1）\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- document_id: 文档ID\n\nL1 格式说明:\n- 标题：文档标题\n- 关键词：3-5个核心概念，用逗号分隔\n- 摘要：50-80字现代中文摘要\n- 实体：命名实体（人名、地名、技术名词）\n- 类型：文档类型（技术文档/合同/报告等）\n- 指针：文件路径或其他定位信息\n\n示例:\nZellij使用指南|终端,复用器,Rust|Zellij终端复用器的基本使用方法和配置说明|Zellij,终端|技术文档|/docs/zellij.md","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"文档存储路径"},"l1":{"type":"string","description":"L1 极简格式摘要"},"l2":{"type":"string","description":"完整内容（可选）"}},"required":["file_path","l1"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/store_documents_l1","description":"批量存储文档的 L1 摘要到向量库\n\n当 ingest_documents 返回 status=\"need_l1\" 时，调用此工具一次性存储所有摘要。\n\n参数:\n- documents: 必填，文档列表，每个包含：\n  - file_path: 文档存储路径\n  - l1: L1 极简格式摘要\n  - l2: 完整内容（可选）\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- total: 总数\n- processed: 成功数\n- failed: 失败数\n- results: 每个文档的处理结果\n\n这是批量处理的首选方式，一次调用完成所有 L1 存储，然后向主 Agent 汇报。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"documents":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string"},"l1":{"type":"string"},"l2":{"type":"string"}},"required":["file_path","l1"]},"description":"文档列表"}},"required":["documents"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"photo-server/unload_face_model","description":"卸载人脸识别模型，释放内存（约 326MB）\n\n在长时间空闲时调用此工具释放内存。\n通常由系统在 SLEEP 状态时自动调用。\n\n返回:\n- status: success\n- message: 卸载结果","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/create_document","description":"Create a document node in the knowledge graph. Use file_path to avoid passing large content through JSON.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"uri":{"type":"string","description":"Unique identifier for the document (e.g., file path)"},"title":{"type":"string","description":"Document title"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"Document content (optional if file_path provided)"},"source":{"type":"string","description":"Source of the document (optional)"},"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to file to read content from (avoids JSON size limits)"}},"required":["uri","title"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/create_entity","description":"Create an entity node (person, organization, etc.) in the knowledge graph.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Unique identifier for the entity"},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Entity name"},"type":{"type":"string","description":"Entity type (e.g., person, organization, location)"},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Entity description (optional)"}},"required":["id","name","type"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/create_concept","description":"Create a concept node in the knowledge graph.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Concept name"},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Concept description (optional)"}},"required":["name"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/link_document_entity","description":"Link a document to an entity (MENTIONS relation).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"doc_uri":{"type":"string","description":"Document URI"},"entity_id":{"type":"string","description":"Entity ID"}},"required":["doc_uri","entity_id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/link_document_concept","description":"Link a document to a concept (CONTAINS relation).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"doc_uri":{"type":"string","description":"Document URI"},"concept_name":{"type":"string","description":"Concept name"}},"required":["doc_uri","concept_name"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/link_entities","description":"Create a relation between two entities.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity1_id":{"type":"string","description":"First entity ID"},"entity2_id":{"type":"string","description":"Second entity ID"},"relation":{"type":"string","description":"Relation type (e.g., works_for, knows)"}},"required":["entity1_id","entity2_id","relation"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/get_document","description":"Get a document by URI.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"uri":{"type":"string","description":"Document URI"}},"required":["uri"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/list_documents","description":"List all documents in the knowledge graph.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum number of documents to return (default: 10)"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/search_documents","description":"Search documents by keyword.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"keyword":{"type":"string","description":"Search keyword"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum results (default: 10)"}},"required":["keyword"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/get_related_entities","description":"Get entities mentioned in a document.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"doc_uri":{"type":"string","description":"Document URI"}},"required":["doc_uri"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/get_related_concepts","description":"Get concepts contained in a document.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"doc_uri":{"type":"string","description":"Document URI"}},"required":["doc_uri"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kg-server/query_graph","description":"Execute a Cypher query on the knowledge graph.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"cypher":{"type":"string","description":"Cypher query string"}},"required":["cypher"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"vector-store/add_document","description":"Add a document to the vector store for semantic search. Use file_path to avoid passing large content through JSON.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Unique document ID"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"Document content (optional if file_path provided)"},"metadata":{"type":"object","description":"Optional metadata"},"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to file to read content from (avoids JSON size limits)"}},"required":["id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"vector-store/search_documents","description":"Search for similar documents using semantic search. Use filter to narrow results by metadata, e.g. filter={\"type\": \"event\", \"status\": \"pending\"}.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","description":"Search query"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Max results (default: 5)"},"filter":{"type":"object","description":"Optional metadata filter, e.g. {\"type\": \"event\", \"status\": \"pending\"}"}},"required":["query"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"vector-store/get_document","description":"Get a document by ID.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Document ID"}},"required":["id"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"vector-store/delete_document","description":"Delete documents by ID, query (semantic search), or metadata filter. Use filter to delete by type/status, e.g. filter={\"type\": \"event\", \"status\": \"cancelled\"}.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"doc_id":{"type":"string","description":"Document ID to delete (exact match)"},"query":{"type":"string","description":"Delete documents matching content (semantic search, similarity > 0.7)"},"filter":{"type":"object","description":"Delete documents matching metadata filter, e.g. {\"type\": \"event\", \"status\": \"cancelled\"}"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"vector-store/list_documents","description":"List all documents in the vector store, optionally filtered by metadata.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Max results (default: 10)"},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"Offset for pagination (default: 0)"},"filter":{"type":"object","description":"Optional metadata filter, e.g. {\"type\": \"l2\"}"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"vector-store/count_documents","description":"Count total documents in the vector store.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/get_llm_config","description":"Get current LLM configuration (API key is hidden).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/set_llm_config","description":"Set LLM configuration. Use preset_id to load a preset, or provide individual values.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"preset_id":{"type":"string","description":"Preset ID to load (e.g., 'openai', 'anthropic', 'deepseek')"},"api_key":{"type":"string","description":"API key"},"api_base":{"type":"string","description":"API base URL"},"model":{"type":"string","description":"Model name"},"llm_type":{"type":"string","description":"Provider type: 'openai' or 'anthropic'"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/list_llm_presets","description":"List all available LLM presets.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/test_llm_connection","description":"Test LLM connection with current configuration.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/get_storage_config","description":"Get storage configuration (document root, database path).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/set_storage_config","description":"Set storage configuration.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"document_root":{"type":"string","description":"Root directory for documents"},"database_path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to knowledge database"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/get_identity","description":"Get assistant identity settings (name, gender, personality).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/update_identity","description":"Update assistant identity. User can change name, personality, etc.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Assistant name"},"gender":{"type":"string","description":"Gender: 'male' or 'female'"},"personality":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Personality traits (e.g., ['warm', 'professional', 'concise'])"},"greeting_style":{"type":"string","description":"How to greet users"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/get_workspace","description":"Get workspace path where documents and database are stored.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/set_workspace","description":"Set workspace path. This is where all documents and knowledge will be stored.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Workspace directory path (e.g., 'D:\\\\MyKnowledge')"}},"required":["path"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/get_user_info","description":"Get user information (name, preferences).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/set_user_info","description":"Set user information.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"User's name or nickname"},"preferences":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"User preferences (e.g., ['concise answers', 'Chinese'])"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/add_user_preference","description":"Add a user preference to remember.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"preference":{"type":"string","description":"Preference to remember (e.g., 'likes concise answers')"}},"required":["preference"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/is_first_run","description":"Check if this is the first run (need to show setup wizard).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/complete_setup","description":"Complete initial setup with workspace path and optional settings.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"workspace_path":{"type":"string","description":"Workspace directory path"},"user_name":{"type":"string","description":"User's name"},"assistant_name":{"type":"string","description":"Assistant name"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/get_full_memory","description":"Get full memory for system prompt (all settings and info).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"config-manager/mkdir","description":"Create a directory (and parent directories if needed). Use this to create year-based directories like '